    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38857" root="ملج" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَجَ أُمَّهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلُجَ</span></b> ; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِجَهَا</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">??</span>;
(K;) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْجٌ</span>; (S, K;) <i>He</i> (a child) <i>sucked</i>
[<i>the breast of</i>] <i>his mother:</i> (S:) or <i>he took his
mother's teat with the extremity of his mouth.</i>
(S, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَجَ النَّاقَةَ</span>, said of a young camel,
<i>He sucked the she-camel;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَجَهَا</span>. (L, TA,
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سلج</span>.)

